<section class="nc-guide" id="guide">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Healthy-weight range by height</h2>
    <p>The standard adult BMI range of 18.5 to 24.9 translates into these weights. The calculator's default, 5 ft 10 in and 170 lb, gives a BMI of 24.4, near the top of the range for that height.</p>
  </div>
